      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LET'S ENJOY THIS (1) was a last start winner (19.75) at Angle Park who is building a strong winning record. Is yet to miss the placings from this draw, including two wins, from five starts. Sure to prove hard to beat. SOKAI (6) goes very well this course and distance starting five times for two wins and two minors. Placed last time (31.04) at Angle Park in a Grade 6, finishing third and beaten 7 lengths. Can feature in the finish. ADHANA PHILLIP (2) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (22.63) at Murray Bridge behind Stomp Rocker in a Grade 6. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expected to be in the finish again. BIG BOSS GIBLET (8) warrants respect with the drop in journey.",
